ORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Both sources mention the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer when describing badge cleaning.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Both sources state this claim verbatim in their section on returning a badge.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Badges that have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Both sources state this claim verbatim in their section on unreturned badges.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Contractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead of a day badge.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_a.md states this claim verbatim in its section on contractors.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_a.md states this claim verbatim in its section on contractors.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_a.md states this claim verbatim in its section on contractors.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office rather than back into the return tray.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_b.md states this claim verbatim in its section on lost badges found later.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The security office decides whether to reactivate it.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_b.md states this claim verbatim in its section on lost badges found later.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":7623,"type":"result","duration_ms":11520,"uuid":"e8a98fa9-5c3b-4952-a784-e06c14dfb22c","ttft_stream_ms":960,"time_to_request_ms":94,"first_content_frame_ms":960,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
